      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Refs: section, canvas, progressBar, frameLabel.\nLocal variables: alive, near, frame, active, raf.\nCollections: cache Map, pending Map, failed Set.\nGSAP target object: { frame: 0 }.\nUI counters and bars are updated through refs.",
