      "text": "Identity: name, slug, color, title, description.\nFile keys: background, journal.\nPlanet facts: class, diameter, gravity, day, year, temperature, moons, discovered.\n\nValues such as “10,842 km”, “1.02 G”, and “24.7 hours” are presentation strings, not\ncomputed simulation quantities.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
