      "text": "0 Earthys 1 Cosmara 2 Elyria 3 Kairos\n4 Luminaria 5 Nexarion 6 Stellaluna 7 Terraverde\n\nThe index also drives SVG color / icon variants and hard-coded map positions. Home\nmaintains a separate names array.\nAdditions or reordering must synchronize these parallel structures (see frame 12).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "0 Earthys 1 Cosmara 2 Elyria 3 Kairos\n4 Luminaria 5 Nexarion 6 Stellaluna 7 Terraverde\n\nThe index also drives SVG color / icon variants and hard-coded map positions. Home\nmaintains a separate names array.\nAdditions or reordering must synchronize these parallel structures (see frame 12).",
