      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Background → /optimized/backgrounds/{background}.webp\nJournal → /narrative/{journal}.png\n\nEarthys uses EarthysBackground; Terraverde uses the green EarthysBackgroud variant\nand journal TerraVerde. Nexarion’s background key is NaxarionBackgroud.\nThese spellings are intentional references to supplied files; changing them without\nrenaming assets breaks loading.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Background → /optimized/backgrounds/{background}.webp\nJournal → /narrative/{journal}.png\n\nEarthys uses EarthysBackground; Terraverde uses the green EarthysBackgroud variant\nand journal TerraVerde. Nexarion’s background key is NaxarionBackgroud.\nThese spellings are intentional references to supplied files; changing them without\nrenaming assets breaks loading.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 19
    },
