      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Home’s external chooseWorld() scrolls and changes the selected index, but does not\nreset the atlas tab. Only Atlas.choose() resets it.\nThe tab panel has a fixed CSS height with its own overflow. Planet detail is an in-page\nstate change, not a separately shareable route.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Home’s external chooseWorld() scrolls and changes the selected index, but does not\nreset the atlas tab. Only Atlas.choose() resets it.\nThe tab panel has a fixed CSS height with its own overflow. Planet detail is an in-page\nstate change, not a separately shareable route.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
    },
