      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "GSAP animates progress 0→1 over a pinned section.\nonUpdate copies progress into a ref, invokes the viewer’s invalidate callback, and\nsets step=min(2, floor(progress × 3)).\nThe three steps change system text and button state. DOM prose and GPU\ntransforms share the same normalized progress.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "GSAP animates progress 0→1 over a pinned section.\nonUpdate copies progress into a ref, invokes the viewer’s invalidate callback, and\nsets step=min(2, floor(progress × 3)).\nThe three steps change system text and button state. DOM prose and GPU\ntransforms share the same normalized progress.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
    },
