      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "useGLTF(paths[kind], false).\nscene.clone(true) in useMemo.\nBox3 → size and center.\nscale = 3.4 / max(size.x, y, z).\nClone position = −center × scale.\nUniform scale fits very different models into one\nexhibit volume.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "useGLTF(paths[kind], false).\nscene.clone(true) in useMemo.\nBox3 → size and center.\nscale = 3.4 / max(size.x, y, z).\nClone position = −center × scale.\nUniform scale fits very different models into one\nexhibit volume.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 19
    },
