      "text": "Canvas frameloop=\"demand\".\nStage progress update → invalidate() → R3F frame.\nuseFrame reads progress.current and applies\nrotation / position before drawing.\nDragging controls also updates the view.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Canvas frameloop=\"demand\".\nStage progress update → invalidate() → R3F frame.\nuseFrame reads progress.current and applies\nrotation / position before drawing.\nDragging controls also updates the view.",
