      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Perspective camera [0, 0.2, 5.7], FOV 40°.\nDPR clamped to [1, 1.5]; antialias + alpha enabled.\nAmbient light plus warm key, cool side, and warm rear directional lights.\nDrei Environment at resolution 128 contains three Lightformers to build a local\nreflection environment. No remote HDR preset is fetched.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Perspective camera [0, 0.2, 5.7], FOV 40°.\nDPR clamped to [1, 1.5]; antialias + alpha enabled.\nAmbient light plus warm key, cool side, and warm rear directional lights.\nDrei Environment at resolution 128 contains three Lightformers to build a local\nreflection environment. No remote HDR preset is fetched.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
