      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "OrbitControls: pan, zoom, and damping disabled; polar range 0.2π–0.8π.\nStep buttons scroll to start + (end−start) × (index+0.25)/3.\nWith reduced motion or no pin, buttons instead set progress=index/2, invalidate, and\nchange step directly.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "OrbitControls: pan, zoom, and damping disabled; polar range 0.2π–0.8π.\nStep buttons scroll to start + (end−start) × (index+0.25)/3.\nWith reduced motion or no pin, buttons instead set progress=index/2, invalidate, and\nchange step directly.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
