      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "CSS rings, corners, status label, copy, and specs surround the canvas. An Image\nposter covers loading / failure.\nThe camera is fixed for scroll; the model group moves. Pointer controls orbit the\ncamera separately.\nProximity mounting and demand frames limit idle work; GLB loader-cache eviction is\nnot implemented.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "CSS rings, corners, status label, copy, and specs surround the canvas. An Image\nposter covers loading / failure.\nThe camera is fixed for scroll; the model group moves. Pointer controls orbit the\ncamera separately.\nProximity mounting and demand frames limit idle work; GLB loader-cache eviction is\nnot implemented.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
    },
