      "text": "Observer rootMargin=\"700px\".\nnear=true activates pump().\nWanted: current, +1, −1 ... ±10.\nSkip cached / pending / failed.\nUp to 4 pending image requests per sequence.\nURL: {path}/{index}.webp.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
