      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "PlanetIcon(index): SVG sphere, radial gradient, clipped bands / continents / stars;\nKairos adds a ring.\nuseId() creates distinct gradient and clip-path IDs.\nOrbitMark: circle / ellipse / crosshair emblem.\nInline SVGs are decorative (aria-hidden). Parent controls provide the accessible label.\nGSAP rotates .planet-orbit.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "PlanetIcon(index): SVG sphere, radial gradient, clipped bands / continents / stars;\nKairos adds a ring.\nuseId() creates distinct gradient and clip-path IDs.\nOrbitMark: circle / ellipse / crosshair emblem.\nInline SVGs are decorative (aria-hidden). Parent controls provide the accessible label.\nGSAP rotates .planet-orbit.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 20
    },
    {
