      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Motion OFF disables scroll animation effects but does not disable manually orbiting a\nloaded 3D model.\nModel rotation is primarily a drag / scroll interaction; the illustrated poster and surrounding\ndescriptions remain the alternative presentation.\nCSS sets canvas touch-action:pan-y to support vertical page movement. No custom full\nkeyboard model-orbit system is implemented.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Motion OFF disables scroll animation effects but does not disable manually orbiting a\nloaded 3D model.\nModel rotation is primarily a drag / scroll interaction; the illustrated poster and surrounding\ndescriptions remain the alternative presentation.\nCSS sets canvas touch-action:pan-y to support vertical page movement. No custom full\nkeyboard model-orbit system is implemented.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 19
    },
