    {
      "id": "cv-0492",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 3969,
      "y": 5773.2,
      "width": 762,
      "height": 172.9,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#edf2ef",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1.5,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "group-extend-world"
      ],
      "frameId": "cv-0062",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 8596716,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 4513116,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Add lore and file keys to lib/worlds.ts.\n2. Add / prepare the source artwork and journal.\n3. Synchronize Home’s names array, Universe’s coordinates, and PlanetIcon’s colors /\nvariants.\n4. Review eight-world labels, selector grids, modulo navigation, and hero stats.\n5. Verify all public paths and any new accessible labels.\nThe current design assumes eight indexed worlds in several places.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Add lore and file keys to lib/worlds.ts.\n2. Add / prepare the source artwork and journal.\n3. Synchronize Home’s names array, Universe’s coordinates, and PlanetIcon’s colors /\nvariants.\n4. Review eight-world labels, selector grids, modulo navigation, and hero stats.\n5. Verify all public paths and any new accessible labels.\nThe current design assumes eight indexed worlds in several places.",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 19
    },
