      "updated": 1789421174667,
      "created": 1789421174667,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Page entrance + parallax → Home effect.\nAtlas transitions → WorldAtlas effect.\nPin lengths / scrub → ModelStage or ScrollSequence.\nModel transforms / camera / lighting → ModelViewer.\nFrame window / concurrency / DPR → ScrollSequence.\nCompression and frame sampling → preparation script.",
      "fontSize": 19,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Page entrance + parallax → Home effect.\nAtlas transitions → WorldAtlas effect.\nPin lengths / scrub → ModelStage or ScrollSequence.\nModel transforms / camera / lighting → ModelViewer.\nFrame window / concurrency / DPR → ScrollSequence.\nCompression and frame sampling → preparation script.",
      "autoResize": false,
