      "locked": false,
      "text": "This diagram describes the inspected implementation, not a proposed service\narchitecture. Measurements are asset sizes / counts, not benchmark guarantees.\nNo backend persistence, runtime AI, remote data connector, scene-wide retry manager,\nor global memory scheduler exists in the current source.\nKeep behavioral notes synchronized when changing ownership or lifecycles.",
      "fontSize": 19,
